title: "LiDAR-Based Autonomous Exploration with Dubins RRT*"
abstract: >-
  ROS Noetic package for autonomous exploration with a 2D LiDAR: information-gain
  goal sampling, Dubins RRT* path planning and pure pursuit path tracking on a
  TurtleBot (Kobuki), tested in the Stonefish simulator.
type: software
